# Telegram Bot Framework

## Project Overview
This is a comprehensive developer handbook for building Telegram bots with Python using the `python-telegram-bot` library (v20+/v21.x).

## Repository Structure
- `docs/` — 21-chapter developer handbook
- `examples/` — Production-quality bot examples
- `skills/` — AI agent skill definitions
- `agents/` — AI agent configurations

## Code Standards
- Use python-telegram-bot v20+ (async/await)
- PEP 484 type hints throughout
- Error handling and logging in all examples
- PEP 8 compliant code style

## Key Commands
- Install: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
- Run examples: `python examples/echo_bot.py`
- Lint: `ruff check .`
- Type check: `mypy .`

## Security
- Never hardcode tokens
- Use environment variables
- Validate user input
- Follow OWASP guidelines
